    "semanticRules": [
      "`PK(on_deck_package_id,ordinal)`及`UNIQUE(on_deck_package_id,material_key,context_role)`",
      "Primary/structural variant要求Control pair并禁止Related fields",
      "related variant要求source reference/derived authority且Control pair为NULL。每个Run Basis Related必须恰有一row并映射到同Package Product member：carried要求source/final materialKey相同且`replace_or_move`，replaced要求不同且`remove_after_place`",
      "按materialKey/contextRole排序并进入offload及Related disposition set digest，单目标列与多目标JSON列必须恰好一者非NULL",
      "JSON固定schemaRef为`helix://contracts/application-types/LibraOffloadProductMaterialKeys/v1`（仅该array），为2..1024个UTF-8排序唯一materialKey、≤128 KiB，只允许original_input/replaced_and_settled/remove_after_place，原source仍恰好一row",
      "完整目标集合进入member/set/manifest摘要，不构成Arca动作选择或删除授权"
    ],
    "rawContract": {
      "columns": "`on_deck_package_id FK, ordinal, material_key, context_role(original_input|structural_dependency|related_input), source_related_reference_id NULL, final_product_material_key NULL, final_product_material_keys_schema_ref NULL, final_product_material_keys_json NULL, disposition_kind(carried_forward|replaced_and_settled), mount_scope_id, inode, size_bytes, fingerprint_algorithm, fingerprint_version, content_fingerprint, endpoint_id, location, binding_revision, binding_evidence_digest, admitted_control_revision NULL, admitted_control_projection_digest NULL, derived_authority_digest NULL, settlement_expectation(retain|replace_or_move|remove_after_place), context_member_digest`",
      "constraints": "`PK(on_deck_package_id,ordinal)`及`UNIQUE(on_deck_package_id,material_key,context_role)`；Primary/structural variant要求Control pair并禁止Related fields；related variant要求source reference/derived authority且Control pair为NULL。每个Run Basis Related必须恰有一row并映射到同Package Product member：carried要求source/final materialKey相同且`replace_or_move`，replaced要求不同且`remove_after_place`；按materialKey/contextRole排序并进入offload及Related disposition set digest，单目标列与多目标JSON列必须恰好一者非NULL；JSON固定schemaRef为`helix://contracts/application-types/LibraOffloadProductMaterialKeys/v1`（仅该array），为2..1024个UTF-8排序唯一materialKey、≤128 KiB，只允许original_input/replaced_and_settled/remove_after_place，原source仍恰好一row；完整目标集合进入member/set/manifest摘要，不构成Arca动作选择或删除授权"
    },
